course: dictionary
lesson: 163
title: Again and again
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word again is small, but it has three jobs. It can mean one more time, as in «say it again». It can mean back to how it was before, as in «the letters are sharp again». It can also mean many times over, as in «again and again».
explain: Context tells you which meaning to use. «Money that is lost in the street is very rarely found again.» Found again means found one more time after it was lost. Try the sentence with that meaning, and it makes sense.
explain: In maths, again helps you see a pattern. Adding 4 + 4 + 4, again and again, is the same idea as multiplying. Each time you go round, the same thing happens once more.
fact: Again is an adverb, so it tells you more about how or when something happens.
fact: «Again» can mean one more time, as in «try again».
fact: «Again» can mean back to how it was before, as in «the letters are sharp again».
fact: «Again and again» means many times over, as in «Keep adding 4, again and again».
fact: «Never again» means not one more time, ever.
exercise: «Money that is lost in the street is very rarely found again.» What does again mean in this sentence? | Under the street | *One more time | Never at all | Very carefully
exercise: «With new glasses the letters are sharp again.» What does again mean here? | Very, very slowly | Only just | *Back to how they were before | Many times over
exercise: Mia says, «Keep adding 4, again and again.» What does again and again mean? | *Many times over | Only once | Very quickly, all at once | Backwards
test: What does again mean in «see you again»? | Under the ground | Back to how it was | *One more time | Only just
test: What does «never again» mean? | *Not one more time, ever | Very, very fast | Right at the start | Twice as often
exam: Jayden says again only means trying a second time. Is he right? | Yes, again only means trying a second time | *No, again can also mean back to how it was, or many times over | Yes, again only means before | No, again means under the street
